# enclitics.voc — Clitic pronouns that attach AFTER the verb with a hyphen
# ("torno-me", "vejo-o", "fá-lo", "deu-lhe", "tem-nos"). The tokenizer keeps the
# hyphen as a leading marker on the clitic token, so matching here (after
# stripping the "-") is an unambiguous finite-VERB host signal — the hyphen
# rules out the homographic article/preposition readings of o/a/nos/vos, so the
# FULL inventory (incl. allomorphs -lo/-la/-no/-na and combined forms) is safe.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.
me
te
se
lhe
lhes
nos
vos
o
a
os
as
lo
la
los
las
no
na
nas
mo
ma
mos
mas
to
ta
tos
tas
lho
lha
lhos
lhas
